# The kettle and the statue: hard water and limescale
register lv1
add v1 water 500mL
add v1 NaHCO3 1.7g
add v1 CaCl2 1.1g
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 200mL
add v2 CaCO3 1g
add v2 HCl 0.03mol
measure v2 balance
# Softening by mixing: hard water meets soda-ash solution
new
add v3 water 500mL
add v3 CaCl2 0.005mol
add v3 MgSO4 0.003mol
measure v3 ph
new
add v4 water 500mL
add v4 NaCl 0.01mol
new
mix v3 0.5 v4 0.5 into v5
measure v5 ph
